274
00:17:04,206 --> 00:17:05,155
My name is North.

275
00:17:05,260 --> 00:17:06,406
I work as a host.

276
00:17:06,553 --> 00:17:09,783
But with your looks,
you could definitely do it, too.

277
00:17:09,834 --> 00:17:11,027
It's not really my thing.

278
00:17:11,574 --> 00:17:12,324
No problem.

279
00:17:12,734 --> 00:17:14,764
But if you ever change your mind...

280
00:17:15,310 --> 00:17:16,220
Here's my card.

281
00:17:20,181 --> 00:17:23,740
Something about that guy
doesn't sit right with me.

282
00:17:23,993 --> 00:17:26,427
He might be working
for the Black Bull gang.

283
00:17:28,112 --> 00:17:30,094
But he told me he works as a host.

284
00:17:30,452 --> 00:17:32,280
He even asked me to work with him.

285
00:17:32,993 --> 00:17:34,119
It's quite possible.

286
00:17:34,287 --> 00:17:35,421
The big shots...

287
00:17:35,687 --> 00:17:37,554
often throw parties to distribute drugs.

288
00:17:38,206 --> 00:17:39,806
Why don't you give him a call?

289
00:17:40,693 --> 00:17:41,627
Why do I have to do that?

290
00:17:43,281 --> 00:17:44,926
We're going undercover as hosts.

291
00:17:50,190 --> 00:17:57,360
(North)

292
00:18:01,933 --> 00:18:03,139
(Hello?)

293
00:18:04,247 --> 00:18:05,440
Hello, North.

294
00:18:07,174 --> 00:18:08,120
(Who's this?)

295
00:18:09,206 --> 00:18:10,886
It's Mungkorn,

296
00:18:11,014 --> 00:18:12,660
the guy you met at the bathhouse.

297
00:18:13,293 --> 00:18:15,129
You said I was petite,

298
00:18:15,154 --> 00:18:16,200
cute,

299
00:18:16,783 --> 00:18:17,818
and easy to pick up.

300
00:18:17,848 --> 00:18:19,202
Don't you remember?

301
00:18:20,114 --> 00:18:22,701
(Ah, it's little Mungkorn. What's up?)

302
00:18:22,854 --> 00:18:25,374
I'm just calling you to...

303
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:28,401
You know, you asked me to be a host.

304
00:18:28,433 --> 00:18:30,067
I'm actually interested now.

305
00:18:32,553 --> 00:18:33,521
(Really?)

306
00:18:33,914 --> 00:18:35,567
(I happen to be
looking for someone right now.)

307
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:38,620
Really? I could use the money,

308
00:18:38,847 --> 00:18:40,187
but the actual reason is...

309
00:18:40,566 --> 00:18:42,240
I really want to see you

310
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:43,533
because you...

311
00:18:45,446 --> 00:18:46,650
are exactly my type.

312
00:18:47,654 --> 00:18:48,476
(Oh, stop it!)

313
00:18:49,180 --> 00:18:49,983
(Sure thing.)

314
00:18:50,008 --> 00:18:52,670
(We have a VVVIP party coming up.)

315
00:18:52,741 --> 00:18:54,300
(I'll send you the details.)

316
00:18:54,371 --> 00:18:55,906
(I can't wait to see you.)

317
00:18:56,747 --> 00:18:58,060
I'm so happy.

318
00:18:58,085 --> 00:18:59,841
I really want to see you.

319
00:18:59,994 --> 00:19:01,127
See you.

320
00:19:06,353 --> 00:19:08,123
You're actually something else.

321
00:19:08,492 --> 00:19:10,715
I had no idea you were such a flirt.

322
00:19:10,740 --> 00:19:11,729
That's an understatement.

323
00:19:11,993 --> 00:19:14,154
He's got a lot more game than you think.

324
00:19:15,034 --> 00:19:16,640
I just learned it from TikTok.

325
00:19:17,747 --> 00:19:19,256
I think one of these VIPs

326
00:19:19,281 --> 00:19:21,294
might be one of
the Black Bull gang's higher-ups.

327
00:19:23,667 --> 00:19:25,601
So we have to do whatever it takes

328
00:19:26,089 --> 00:19:27,763
to get those higher-ups to pick us.

329
00:19:27,961 --> 00:19:29,276
So that means...

330
00:19:29,634 --> 00:19:31,483
we have to go undercover as hosts.

331
00:19:31,648 --> 00:19:34,588
None of us know how to do that, though.

332
00:19:37,561 --> 00:19:38,409
I know someone...

333
00:19:38,612 --> 00:19:39,927
who could train us.

334
00:19:42,060 --> 00:19:45,702
Welcome, everyone, to...

335
00:19:46,252 --> 00:19:47,887
Host Training...

336
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:50,698
(Host Training 101)
101.

337
00:19:51,034 --> 00:19:54,765
With over 30 years
of experience in host bars,

338
00:19:54,827 --> 00:19:57,636
I'm here to teach you all
about being a host

339
00:19:57,668 --> 00:20:00,397
and how to land a client.

340
00:20:05,690 --> 00:20:08,343
(Black Bull Agent Party)

341
00:20:15,133 --> 00:20:16,416
You look like an anime character.

342
00:20:16,787 --> 00:20:18,543
We had to change up our looks,
didn't we?

343
00:20:18,654 --> 00:20:19,827
Do you see those guys?

344
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:22,080
They're on our most-wanted list.

345
00:20:22,980 --> 00:20:25,340
We need to find enough evidence
to take them down.

346
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:27,875
Understood.

347
00:20:28,244 --> 00:20:29,940
Tonight, I'm going all out

348
00:20:30,913 --> 00:20:32,260
for the sake of our mission.

349
00:20:33,420 --> 00:20:33,821
Let's do this.

350
00:20:33,846 --> 00:20:35,540
Let's start with the first rule.

351
00:20:35,571 --> 00:20:37,969
It's all about eye contact.

352
00:20:37,994 --> 00:20:38,660
(1. Eye Contact)

353
00:20:38,685 --> 00:20:40,372
Imagine...

354
00:20:40,634 --> 00:20:43,967
the person in front of you is a client.

355
00:20:44,467 --> 00:20:47,860
You should be thinking, "I'm handsome,"

356
00:20:48,214 --> 00:20:49,853
or, "Pick me."

357
00:20:50,753 --> 00:20:51,863
Are you sleepy, Captain?

358
00:20:53,079 --> 00:20:53,712
No.

359
00:20:53,818 --> 00:20:54,599
Seductive.

360
00:20:54,994 --> 00:20:56,247
Hello.

361
00:20:56,818 --> 00:20:58,059
What's your name?

362
00:20:58,100 --> 00:21:00,479
Use your eyes to charm them.

363
00:21:00,714 --> 00:21:02,302
Look into their eyes.

364
00:21:02,446 --> 00:21:04,140
You'll love my service.

365
00:21:06,213 --> 00:21:06,940
Oh...

366
00:21:08,814 --> 00:21:09,627
Are you okay?

367
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:12,400
I'm fine.

368
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:19,040
Isn't that a bit much already?

369
00:21:20,053 --> 00:21:21,393
You're going to be picked
all night long.

370
00:21:21,418 --> 00:21:22,993
Hey, we're here to work.

371
00:21:23,234 --> 00:21:24,573
You can't be getting jealous of me.

372
00:21:25,359 --> 00:21:27,840
Come on, I'm all yours anyway.

373
00:21:29,627 --> 00:21:31,700
Let's move on to the second rule,

374
00:21:31,754 --> 00:21:33,008
and that is...

375
00:21:33,338 --> 00:21:34,610
(2. The Smile)
the smile, of course.

376
00:21:36,093 --> 00:21:37,023
That's it!

377
00:21:37,427 --> 00:21:39,010
Look, look at him.

378
00:21:39,153 --> 00:21:40,372
Just like this smile.

379
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:42,093
This is exactly how a good host smiles.

380
00:21:42,226 --> 00:21:43,311
Now, you give it a try.

381
00:21:45,313 --> 00:21:46,440
No way. That's a no.

382
00:21:46,465 --> 00:21:47,819
Both your eyes and your smile.

383
00:21:47,844 --> 00:21:48,740
You're literally shaking.

384
00:21:48,778 --> 00:21:49,678
Now, you two.

385
00:21:49,988 --> 00:21:51,391
Start with the eye contact.

386
00:21:52,045 --> 00:21:55,245
Now give a gentle, slight smirk.

387
00:22:01,573 --> 00:22:02,373
Hey...

388
00:22:03,022 --> 00:22:04,576
Are you guys for real?

389
00:22:05,260 --> 00:22:06,716
I just did what you told us to.

390
00:22:20,886 --> 00:22:21,689
Wanna come with me?

391
00:22:21,714 --> 00:22:22,774
I asked if you wanna come with me.

392
00:22:22,799 --> 00:22:23,409
No, thanks.

393
00:22:23,434 --> 00:22:24,295
No? Come on.

394
00:22:24,320 --> 00:22:25,196
Hey, North.

395
00:22:27,707 --> 00:22:28,836
What's up, Mungkorn?

396
00:22:29,270 --> 00:22:30,867
I thought you weren't going to show up.

397
00:22:31,153 --> 00:22:32,536
How could I not?

398
00:22:32,847 --> 00:22:34,770
We barely talked last time.

399
00:22:34,861 --> 00:22:36,144
This is my husband.

400
00:22:36,573 --> 00:22:37,980
His name is...

401
00:22:38,025 --> 00:22:39,086
I'm Hunglay.

402
00:22:40,336 --> 00:22:42,417
Glad to see you again.

403
00:22:43,520 --> 00:22:45,290
Let's move on to the third rule.

404
00:22:45,315 --> 00:22:46,980
This is the most important one

405
00:22:47,005 --> 00:22:48,298
because this...

406
00:22:48,323 --> 00:22:51,612
is how we'll infiltrate
the Black Bull gang.

407
00:22:51,867 --> 00:22:54,818
It's all about the touch.

408
00:22:54,843 --> 00:22:55,618
(3. Touch)

409
00:22:57,107 --> 00:23:00,654
Sorry for being too serious last time.

410
00:23:03,500 --> 00:23:05,520
Let's start the practice session.

411
00:23:06,574 --> 00:23:07,374
Look.

412
00:23:07,700 --> 00:23:08,647
Flash a smile.

413
00:23:08,672 --> 00:23:09,534
Correct.

414
00:23:09,653 --> 00:23:10,674
Closer.

415
00:23:11,060 --> 00:23:12,787
Make the client's heart race.

416
00:23:12,872 --> 00:23:14,327
- Does it have to be this close?
- "Hello."

417
00:23:14,706 --> 00:23:16,234
- "Hi."
- Excuse me.

418
00:23:18,547 --> 00:23:20,063
- I think this is too close.
- Cut!

419
00:23:20,107 --> 00:23:21,663
You did a great job.

420
00:23:23,533 --> 00:23:25,117
Let's move to this couple.

421
00:23:25,300 --> 00:23:26,950
It's finally our turn.

422
00:23:28,334 --> 00:23:30,334
I'm quite a pro
at the whole touching thing.

423
00:24:15,353 --> 00:24:16,343
Let's stop it here.

424
00:24:18,346 --> 00:24:19,936
I think I've got the hang of it.

425
00:24:20,306 --> 00:24:21,648
Great!

426
00:24:21,949 --> 00:24:22,653
Good job.

427
00:24:22,670 --> 00:24:24,156
You've earned 100 drinks!

428
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:25,235
Just like that!

429
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:29,651
And that is the complete course
for Host Training 101.

430
00:24:29,776 --> 00:24:32,923
Now you're all ready to hunt.

431
00:24:39,292 --> 00:24:41,892
Are we all going to be hosts together?

432
00:24:42,127 --> 00:24:44,260
No. It'll just be me and Mungkorn.

433
00:24:44,347 --> 00:24:44,956
What?

434
00:24:45,800 --> 00:24:47,483
Then why the hell
did you make me do all this?

435
00:24:56,100 --> 00:24:57,980
I want to try being a host, too.

436
00:24:58,360 --> 00:25:01,060
Being stuck on lookout duty with you
isn't exciting at all.

437
00:25:01,520 --> 00:25:02,970
If you want some excitement,
you're free to leave.

438
00:25:03,080 --> 00:25:04,040
I'm not stopping you.

439
00:25:04,150 --> 00:25:04,920
Nah.

440
00:25:05,170 --> 00:25:06,440
I don't want to leave you by yourself,

441
00:25:06,650 --> 00:25:07,680
or you'll get lonely.

442
00:25:09,190 --> 00:25:10,280
I won't be lonely.

443
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:12,710
If anything, I'd actually be relieved.

444
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:14,950
Give it a rest.

445
00:25:15,370 --> 00:25:16,540
Do you find me annoying?

446
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:18,860
Or are you afraid that...

447
00:25:19,380 --> 00:25:21,360
you won't be able to resist
if we're too close,

448
00:25:21,730 --> 00:25:22,840
so you're shooing me away?

449
00:25:23,450 --> 00:25:25,230
I know my charm is irresistible.

450
00:25:28,490 --> 00:25:30,610
I admire your optimism, Captain.

451
00:25:38,260 --> 00:25:39,490
That red hair of yours...

452
00:25:40,090 --> 00:25:41,020
I like it.

453
00:25:41,850 --> 00:25:46,340
Since you're here with your husband,
what am I supposed to do?

454
00:25:46,690 --> 00:25:47,650
It's fine.

455
00:25:48,330 --> 00:25:50,820
We're in an open relationship.

456
00:25:51,770 --> 00:25:53,360
We just go out to have some fun...

457
00:25:54,560 --> 00:25:56,110
and come back to each other.

458
00:25:58,590 --> 00:25:59,340
Got it.

459
00:25:59,710 --> 00:26:01,380
An open relationship sounds nice.

460
00:26:01,670 --> 00:26:02,640
So...

461
00:26:05,370 --> 00:26:07,000
no jealousy tonight, then?

462
00:26:13,770 --> 00:26:14,980
Not at all.

463
00:26:15,750 --> 00:26:17,743
Mungkorn likes a bit of a thrill.

464
00:26:18,870 --> 00:26:19,840
Let's have a toast.

465
00:26:39,360 --> 00:26:41,480
By the way, who's that?

466
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:44,390
He's been staring at us for a while.

467
00:26:45,980 --> 00:26:47,540
That's Mr. Tiannan,

468
00:26:47,730 --> 00:26:50,610
an ultra-VIP that we have to land.

469
00:26:51,010 --> 00:26:53,680
If anyone manages to close the deal with him,
they're set.

470
00:26:54,040 --> 00:26:56,620
He's got plenty of resources
to keep the party going.

471
00:26:57,260 --> 00:26:58,290
Make sure you look good.

472
00:27:07,590 --> 00:27:09,630
Hey, one of the guests
wants to speak with you.

473
00:27:09,880 --> 00:27:10,990
Two of you, actually.

474
00:27:14,350 --> 00:27:15,570
Let's go, Mungkorn.

475
00:27:17,220 --> 00:27:18,360
Not you, though.

476
00:27:19,150 --> 00:27:20,250
He wants these two.

477
00:27:45,980 --> 00:27:46,930
Open the door.

478
00:27:47,520 --> 00:27:48,800
Open the door!

479
00:27:50,550 --> 00:27:51,980
I said open the damn door!

480
00:27:52,940 --> 00:27:54,370
- Kiss me.
- I said open up!

481
00:27:54,400 --> 00:27:55,200
Kiss me.

482
00:27:55,450 --> 00:27:57,250
- What?
- I said kiss me.

483
00:28:05,500 --> 00:28:06,160
Whoa!

484
00:28:06,420 --> 00:28:07,450
What the hell are you doing?

485
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:11,520
Oh, I just felt like the mood was right,

486
00:28:11,550 --> 00:28:13,470
so we just pulled over
and got to it right here.

487
00:28:14,050 --> 00:28:15,030
You can't do that.

488
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:16,480
This is private property,

489
00:28:16,630 --> 00:28:18,090
and they're having a party inside.

490
00:28:18,190 --> 00:28:19,130
I see.

491
00:28:19,150 --> 00:28:22,140
Look, go straight for 2 kilometers
and you'll find a hotel.

492
00:28:22,280 --> 00:28:23,990
Go get a room. Now!

493
00:28:24,560 --> 00:28:26,610
My boyfriend likes it outdoors.

494
00:28:27,760 --> 00:28:29,150
But not here.

495
00:28:29,260 --> 00:28:30,660
Go do it somewhere else. Leave now!

496
00:28:32,010 --> 00:28:32,810
Got it.

497
00:28:34,410 --> 00:28:35,940
Hey, nothing to see here!

498
00:28:58,750 --> 00:28:59,690
What are you looking at?

499
00:29:18,630 --> 00:29:19,600
Where are you guys from?

500
00:29:20,520 --> 00:29:21,850
How come I've never seen you before?

501
00:29:25,120 --> 00:29:27,220
I'm from Lampang.

502
00:29:27,420 --> 00:29:29,760
As for my partner...

503
00:29:30,060 --> 00:29:32,850
he's from Mae Hong Son.

504
00:29:33,890 --> 00:29:34,900
You're a couple?

505
00:29:36,140 --> 00:29:37,390
How did you two meet?

506
00:29:38,760 --> 00:29:40,080
We met at a police station.

507
00:29:42,800 --> 00:29:44,290
Well, that day...

508
00:29:44,500 --> 00:29:46,910
I got drug-tested and tested positive,

509
00:29:47,830 --> 00:29:49,510
and I happened to run into him.

510
00:29:49,590 --> 00:29:51,220
Same charge and everything.

511
00:29:51,270 --> 00:29:52,420
I thought it was fate.

512
00:29:54,940 --> 00:29:55,600
Good.

513
00:29:56,320 --> 00:29:57,660
I've got something special for you.

514
00:30:01,490 --> 00:30:03,040
I'm Tiannan.

515
00:30:08,620 --> 00:30:11,280
I'm Hunglay.

516
00:30:12,230 --> 00:30:13,910
My partner is...

517
00:30:14,450 --> 00:30:15,550
Dragon.

518
00:30:19,060 --> 00:30:21,140
You're letting him answer everything?

519
00:30:21,540 --> 00:30:22,550
Can't you talk?

520
00:30:25,610 --> 00:30:26,810
I can.

521
00:30:28,100 --> 00:30:29,850
I'm just feeling a bit shy right now.

522
00:30:30,760 --> 00:30:33,980
Actually, you're exactly my type.

523
00:30:37,320 --> 00:30:38,990
You're my type, too.

524
00:30:40,490 --> 00:30:41,330
Petite.

525
00:30:42,140 --> 00:30:43,010
Easy to pick up.

526
00:30:44,620 --> 00:30:45,420
Tonight...

527
00:30:46,540 --> 00:30:48,430
we're going to have some fun.

528
00:30:57,710 --> 00:31:00,780
What are you going to do to us?

529
00:31:01,470 --> 00:31:02,900
I'm dying with excitement.

530
00:31:05,100 --> 00:31:05,850
You're excited?

531
00:31:05,900 --> 00:31:06,880
How about some treats?

532
00:31:07,840 --> 00:31:10,320
It helps you feel more relaxed.

533
00:31:22,380 --> 00:31:23,090
Treats.

534
00:31:25,762 --> 00:31:27,020
Let's have some, shall we?

535
00:31:29,310 --> 00:31:30,850
Eat up.

536
00:31:47,180 --> 00:31:48,850
I wanted another piece.

537
00:31:50,260 --> 00:31:53,400
Well, he just had some last night.

538
00:31:53,420 --> 00:31:56,040
He's still feeling the buzz.

539
00:31:57,190 --> 00:31:58,000
Okay.

540
00:31:58,700 --> 00:32:00,260
You really love your partner, huh?

541
00:32:01,120 --> 00:32:02,000
Not bad.

542
00:32:02,280 --> 00:32:05,050
I don't know if those two
will be too much for you, though.

543
00:32:05,810 --> 00:32:06,810
You know,

544
00:32:07,710 --> 00:32:09,170
in the next 15 minutes,

545
00:32:09,990 --> 00:32:13,010
we're going to take a trip
to Fantasyland.

546
00:32:19,440 --> 00:32:21,150
Don't you worry about it.

547
00:32:21,840 --> 00:32:22,900
I mean...

548
00:32:24,270 --> 00:32:26,790
I'm dying to take you with me.

549
00:32:36,230 --> 00:32:37,730
Now that's what I'm talking about.

550
00:32:37,970 --> 00:32:40,180
My radar told me to pick you,
and it was right.

551
00:32:41,750 --> 00:32:43,640
Let's get ready
to explore Fantasyland with me.

552
00:32:44,040 --> 00:32:45,460
Tell me where you want to go.

553
00:32:46,010 --> 00:32:48,120
I've got a VVIP passport right here.

554
00:32:48,150 --> 00:32:49,510
Whoa, that's firm.

555
00:32:49,520 --> 00:32:50,600
Very firm.

556
00:33:03,790 --> 00:33:04,460
Wine, sir.

557
00:33:06,180 --> 00:33:07,070
Thank you.

558
00:33:07,940 --> 00:33:08,840
You're cute.

559
00:33:09,410 --> 00:33:10,410
Want to sit with me?

560
00:33:11,580 --> 00:33:12,650
No, thank you.

561
00:33:12,680 --> 00:33:14,990
I'm on staff.
I have to get back to work.

562
00:33:15,280 --> 00:33:16,660
With your looks,

563
00:33:17,070 --> 00:33:18,220
why don't you work for me?

564
00:33:18,573 --> 00:33:21,123
I'll make sure you get rich.

565
00:33:22,830 --> 00:33:23,810
I'm good, sir.

566
00:33:24,040 --> 00:33:25,390
I'm not ready to be rich yet.

567
00:33:28,190 --> 00:33:28,910
Hey.

568
00:33:31,880 --> 00:33:33,290
With a face like yours,

569
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:36,550
one cheek pinch
could earn you a thousand.

570
00:33:37,560 --> 00:33:39,650
In one night,
you'd make a hundred thousand.

571
00:33:42,280 --> 00:33:42,930
Hey!

572
00:33:43,810 --> 00:33:44,610
What are you doing?

573
00:33:46,800 --> 00:33:48,440
No one touches my boyfriend's cheeks.

574
00:33:49,980 --> 00:33:51,690
Wait, he's also taken?

575
00:33:51,790 --> 00:33:52,580
Yeah.

576
00:33:53,310 --> 00:33:55,420
Only I get to touch his cheeks.

577
00:34:00,100 --> 00:34:00,990
We're really sorry.

578
00:34:05,860 --> 00:34:06,670
Phuwin,

579
00:34:06,940 --> 00:34:09,290
you can't be jealous like this.
We're on duty.

580
00:34:09,740 --> 00:34:11,160
But he was going to touch your cheek.

581
00:34:11,583 --> 00:34:13,400
I don't like it. I'm jealous.

582
00:34:14,460 --> 00:34:15,690
You're acting suspicious.

583
00:34:16,150 --> 00:34:17,260
You're going to get us caught.

584
00:34:17,730 --> 00:34:18,950
Keep your cool, Phuwin.

585
00:34:20,236 --> 00:34:21,890
Then you'd better stop being so cute

586
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:23,310
so I won't get jealous.

587
00:34:27,780 --> 00:34:29,660
Come on, get back to work.

588
00:35:01,050 --> 00:35:02,260
Hunglay, are you okay?

589
00:35:03,670 --> 00:35:04,870
I'm fine.

590
00:35:05,690 --> 00:35:07,410
These drugs can't affect me.

591
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:10,080
I'm ready for the two of you
to serve me now.

592
00:36:10,720 --> 00:36:11,900
Let me see...

593
00:36:12,520 --> 00:36:13,540
what special moves you've got.

594
00:36:14,830 --> 00:36:16,750
I'm going to make sure...

595
00:36:18,230 --> 00:36:20,330
you never forget this night.

596
00:36:23,050 --> 00:36:25,080
I promise I've got more moves...

597
00:36:26,783 --> 00:36:29,793
than you'd see in any dance class.

598
00:36:49,170 --> 00:36:50,980
Anyway,

599
00:36:51,060 --> 00:36:54,410
how about we do something
to stimulate the mood?

600
00:36:55,280 --> 00:36:56,290
Stimulate?

601
00:36:56,530 --> 00:36:57,470
Stimulate what?

602
00:36:58,210 --> 00:36:59,940
Well, we are going to...

603
00:37:00,683 --> 00:37:05,870
give you a four-hand massage.

604
00:37:08,020 --> 00:37:09,110
That sounds good.

605
00:37:09,390 --> 00:37:10,890
I'm really stiff right now.

606
00:37:11,206 --> 00:37:12,426
If we do it right away,

607
00:37:12,762 --> 00:37:14,412
it won't be exciting.

608
00:37:14,980 --> 00:37:16,970
Let's take our time,

609
00:37:18,089 --> 00:37:19,830
nice and slow.

610
00:37:22,813 --> 00:37:23,723
Does this feel good?

611
00:37:24,220 --> 00:37:25,290
Yeah.

612
00:37:26,970 --> 00:37:27,900
Wow.

613
00:37:29,886 --> 00:37:32,560
Would you mind
if I adjusted the frequency?

614
00:37:38,730 --> 00:37:40,220
The frequency is already set.

615
00:37:41,260 --> 00:37:43,420
I need to tune the other side, too.

616
00:37:51,970 --> 00:37:52,830
Tiannan...

617
00:37:53,590 --> 00:37:54,140
What?

618
00:37:54,270 --> 00:37:57,630
I think you should take a shower first.

619
00:37:58,570 --> 00:38:00,950
So the massage will be smooth,

620
00:38:01,476 --> 00:38:03,620
and you'll feel more relaxed.

621
00:38:05,370 --> 00:38:07,020
But I've already showered.

622
00:38:09,070 --> 00:38:11,100
We need to apply massage oil, though.

623
00:38:11,640 --> 00:38:13,520
We'll apply it all over your body.

624
00:38:13,550 --> 00:38:15,050
Oh, okay. Oil...

625
00:38:15,120 --> 00:38:15,960
Got it.

626
00:38:16,510 --> 00:38:17,900
Apply it to every part of me.

627
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:18,890
Of course.

628
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,020
- Every single part?
- Yeah.

629
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:23,710
I'll walk you to the bathroom.

630
00:38:23,730 --> 00:38:25,430
Make sure
you clean yourself thoroughly.

631
00:38:25,470 --> 00:38:27,180
I'll be waiting for you.

632
00:38:40,390 --> 00:38:41,720
Keep a lookout.

633
00:38:52,890 --> 00:38:53,700
There's nothing here.

634
00:38:53,720 --> 00:38:54,950
We need to check that room.

635
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:02,070
Find anything, Inspector?

636
00:39:02,200 --> 00:39:03,230
I can't find a thing.

637
00:39:03,720 --> 00:39:06,500
Gosh, it only takes five minutes
to shower.

638
00:39:06,520 --> 00:39:07,980
Yeah, I am looking right now!

639
00:39:26,590 --> 00:39:28,925
I found it! I think this is it.

640
00:39:28,950 --> 00:39:31,410
- Found it. It's a full list of names.
- Let me take a look.

641
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:34,060
It's a complete list
of everyone involved.

642
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:35,540
Let me see.

643
00:39:42,230 --> 00:39:43,220
It's real.

644
00:39:44,240 --> 00:39:45,460
He's not getting away this time.

645
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:47,360
We've found the boss.

646
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,100
So...

647
00:39:49,530 --> 00:39:50,480
I'm pretty good, right?

648
00:39:50,750 --> 00:39:52,050
You're amazing, Inspector.

649
00:39:52,740 --> 00:39:53,950
How about a reward?

650
00:39:54,940 --> 00:39:56,040
What kind of reward?

651
00:39:57,700 --> 00:39:58,620
Inspector...

652
00:39:59,219 --> 00:40:00,730
You can't do it here.

653
00:40:02,720 --> 00:40:03,460
Hey!

654
00:40:05,420 --> 00:40:06,460
What the hell are you doing?

655
00:40:07,870 --> 00:40:09,440
Why are you messing with my stuff?

656
00:40:11,980 --> 00:40:12,970
What's the problem?

657
00:40:13,130 --> 00:40:15,820
I was just looking for some oil
for your massage.

658
00:40:16,180 --> 00:40:17,180
Bullsh*t!

659
00:40:19,670 --> 00:40:21,240
You two are cops, aren't you?

660
00:40:23,730 --> 00:40:25,310
Sh*t. Damn it.

661
00:40:25,440 --> 00:40:26,580
I knew something was off.

662
00:40:27,620 --> 00:40:28,920
I've been all over Chiang Mai,

663
00:40:30,400 --> 00:40:32,500
but I've never seen anyone like you two.

664
00:40:34,210 --> 00:40:36,510
Wait, just take it easy.

665
00:40:37,220 --> 00:40:38,860
The thing is, the two of us...

666
00:40:39,470 --> 00:40:41,750
just came down from the mountains.

667
00:40:41,900 --> 00:40:43,620
Even your accent is wrong.

668
00:40:44,430 --> 00:40:45,530
You trying to play me?

669
00:40:45,890 --> 00:40:46,510
Are you?

670
00:40:48,580 --> 00:40:50,050
You've got some nerve
coming into my territory.

671
00:40:50,680 --> 00:40:53,020
You are leaving in body bags.

672
00:40:59,855 --> 00:41:01,020
You little sh*ts!

673
00:41:01,780 --> 00:41:02,890
Sh*t!

674
00:41:04,640 --> 00:41:05,265
You bastard!

675
00:41:05,290 --> 00:41:05,694
You...

676
00:41:11,490 --> 00:41:12,790
I think something's going down inside.

677
00:41:30,660 --> 00:41:31,350
F*ck!

678
00:41:35,640 --> 00:41:36,490
Let me go!

679
00:41:51,650 --> 00:41:52,430
What are you doing?

680
00:41:52,460 --> 00:41:53,250
What the hell?

681
00:41:58,490 --> 00:41:59,590
Let go of me!

682
00:42:00,550 --> 00:42:01,510
Let go of me!

683
00:42:03,850 --> 00:42:04,590
Hey!

684
00:42:05,290 --> 00:42:06,230
What are you doing?

685
00:42:30,910 --> 00:42:31,610
Let's go.

686
00:42:34,970 --> 00:42:36,400
You useless bunch of idiots!

687
00:42:36,790 --> 00:42:37,990
F*ck you!

688
00:42:39,150 --> 00:42:40,330
Hey, let's go!

689
00:42:50,770 --> 00:42:51,519
Phuwin, watch out!

690
00:43:03,340 --> 00:43:04,190
Come on!

691
00:43:09,760 --> 00:43:11,380
Hey, we were just about to leave.

692
00:43:11,520 --> 00:43:12,620
Stop with the bullsh*t.

693
00:43:12,680 --> 00:43:14,020
I know you're cops.

694
00:43:14,280 --> 00:43:15,340
We're not.

695
00:43:15,840 --> 00:43:17,120
Watch out, Captain!

696
00:43:21,810 --> 00:43:22,650
Are you hurt?

697
00:43:27,636 --> 00:43:28,263
Blood...

698
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:35,290
Let go of me!

699
00:43:35,593 --> 00:43:36,490
Get down!

700
00:43:38,720 --> 00:43:39,740
Let me go!

701
00:43:42,310 --> 00:43:43,060
Wait...

702
00:43:43,750 --> 00:43:44,400
Hey,

703
00:43:44,710 --> 00:43:46,700
your eyebrow is bleeding.

704
00:43:47,070 --> 00:43:47,990
Are you alright?

705
00:43:48,640 --> 00:43:49,310
I'm fine.

706
00:43:50,000 --> 00:43:50,710
It's nothing.

707
00:43:56,015 --> 00:43:56,795
Mungkorn...

708
00:43:56,820 --> 00:43:57,830
- Are you holding up?
- I can't...

709
00:43:59,750 --> 00:44:01,660
Damn, it's freaking hot.

710
00:44:01,990 --> 00:44:03,140
Hang in there, Inspector.

711
00:44:18,480 --> 00:44:20,120
I think the drug is starting to kick in.

712
00:44:20,680 --> 00:44:22,150
You might not be able to handle it.

713
00:44:22,540 --> 00:44:23,730
I'll be fine.

714
00:44:23,920 --> 00:44:26,260
I'll use the effects to my advantage,

715
00:44:26,870 --> 00:44:28,520
but you have to help me stay focused.

716
00:44:52,120 --> 00:44:53,263
Inspector, watch out!

717
00:45:20,040 --> 00:45:20,780
Mungkorn,

718
00:45:21,380 --> 00:45:23,596
why are you such a good dancer?

719
00:45:25,480 --> 00:45:27,890
Inspector, what on earth
are you seeing right now?

720
00:45:30,030 --> 00:45:31,060
Kiss me.

721
00:45:32,050 --> 00:45:33,180
It'll help clear my head.

722
00:45:34,720 --> 00:45:35,510
Inspector!

723
00:45:37,150 --> 00:45:37,820
Whoa...

724
00:45:38,210 --> 00:45:39,640
Get it together!

725
00:45:41,770 --> 00:45:42,790
You want it rough?

726
00:45:47,400 --> 00:45:48,360
Inspector!

727
00:46:45,890 --> 00:46:47,410
I'll take care of you, Mungkorn.

728
00:46:47,740 --> 00:46:48,980
I trust you, Inspector.

729
00:46:56,750 --> 00:46:58,380
Can you handle this, Thear?

730
00:46:58,740 --> 00:46:59,700
I certainly can.

731
00:47:20,709 --> 00:47:21,929
Thear!

732
00:47:31,250 --> 00:47:32,110
Inspector!

733
00:47:33,040 --> 00:47:33,760
Hey!

734
00:47:34,800 --> 00:47:36,336
Inspector, stop!

735
00:47:38,900 --> 00:47:40,500
- Stop! Let me go.
- Inspector!

736
00:47:43,320 --> 00:47:44,420
Hold on...

737
00:47:45,190 --> 00:47:46,560
I don't think you can do this anymore.

738
00:47:47,290 --> 00:47:49,160
Better let the others handle the rest.

739
00:47:53,580 --> 00:47:54,290
Mungkorn...

740
00:47:56,540 --> 00:47:57,330
Hey,

741
00:47:58,100 --> 00:47:59,560
I'm not holding you back, am I?

742
00:48:00,580 --> 00:48:01,550
Not at all.

743
00:48:03,380 --> 00:48:04,820
You were amazing, Inspector.

744
00:48:12,020 --> 00:48:13,420
Die, you bastards!

745
00:48:18,350 --> 00:48:19,020
Hey...

746
00:48:20,750 --> 00:48:22,160
You should sit down first.

747
00:48:22,860 --> 00:48:23,900
Take it slow.

748
00:48:24,550 --> 00:48:26,060
Just stay with me.

749
00:48:29,890 --> 00:48:31,490
I'm pressing on the wound. Hang in there.

750
00:48:34,930 --> 00:48:37,110
Goddammit, you shot my husband!

751
00:48:38,150 --> 00:48:39,640
You raided my hideout.

752
00:48:40,180 --> 00:48:40,750
How dare you?

753
00:48:42,490 --> 00:48:43,720
You two are a couple, huh?

754
00:48:45,980 --> 00:48:47,240
Then you can die together,

755
00:48:47,380 --> 00:48:48,120
you bastards!

756
00:48:53,657 --> 00:48:55,530
Stop! Goddammit.

757
00:48:56,770 --> 00:48:57,480
Mungkorn!

758
00:48:57,670 --> 00:48:59,643
- Who the hell are you?
- Are you okay, Inspector?

759
00:48:59,668 --> 00:49:00,370
What is this?

760
00:49:00,395 --> 00:49:02,550
Stay with me, alright?

761
00:49:02,580 --> 00:49:04,340
Just breathe. In and out.

762
00:49:05,530 --> 00:49:06,760
Are you hurt, Inspector?

763
00:49:06,780 --> 00:49:07,535
I'm fine.

764
00:49:07,560 --> 00:49:08,720
Listen, I'm pressing on the wound.

765
00:49:08,890 --> 00:49:09,780
Mungkorn!

766
00:49:10,100 --> 00:49:12,210
Phuwin, call an ambulance now!

767
00:49:13,360 --> 00:49:14,395
I'll keep the pressure on.

768
00:49:14,420 --> 00:49:15,995
- Hey, round up all the suspects
- Stay with me.

769
00:49:16,020 --> 00:49:17,660
- and get an ambulance here immediately!
- Are you okay?

770
00:49:17,690 --> 00:49:18,470
Yes, sir.

771
00:49:18,490 --> 00:49:19,350
I'm fine.

772
00:49:20,370 --> 00:49:21,270
Stay with me.

773
00:49:23,650 --> 00:49:24,430
Mungkorn,

774
00:49:24,450 --> 00:49:26,025
you're going to be okay.

775
00:49:26,050 --> 00:49:26,820
Stay awake.

776
00:49:26,840 --> 00:49:28,600
- I'm okay, Inspector.
- Listen.

777
00:49:28,830 --> 00:49:30,963
I want some shaved ice.

778
00:49:31,080 --> 00:49:32,720
Shaved ice? Of course.

779
00:49:32,880 --> 00:49:34,120
I'll make sure you get to eat it.

780
00:49:34,150 --> 00:49:35,205
It's my treat.

781
00:49:35,230 --> 00:49:36,200
- Promise?
- Excuse me,

782
00:49:36,600 --> 00:49:37,760
friends aren't allowed inside.

783
00:49:37,890 --> 00:49:39,556
I'm not a friend.
I'm his husband.

784
00:49:39,600 --> 00:49:41,960
Then please wait outside
and fill out the patient's information.

785
00:50:29,670 --> 00:50:32,540
I, Inspector Thear, solemnly swear...

786
00:50:32,720 --> 00:50:36,460
that I will be
a good husband to you forever.

787
00:50:39,610 --> 00:50:43,063
I promise to be a good husband

788
00:50:43,780 --> 00:50:45,720
to share in both joy and sorrow

789
00:50:46,260 --> 00:50:48,020
and never leave your side.

790
00:53:08,240 --> 00:53:09,600
Mungkorn's going to be okay.

791
00:53:10,650 --> 00:53:12,090
Even if he is okay,

792
00:53:13,120 --> 00:53:15,320
I'm not letting those bastards
get away with this.

793
00:53:15,810 --> 00:53:16,940
They freaking hurt Mungkorn.

794
00:53:17,510 --> 00:53:18,940
I know you're worried about him,

795
00:53:19,980 --> 00:53:21,580
but don't you dare do it alone.

796
00:53:21,950 --> 00:53:22,760
Yeah.

797
00:53:23,660 --> 00:53:25,560
Everyone here is worried about him.

798
00:53:25,760 --> 00:53:27,580
But if you're going,
we're going together.

799
00:53:36,360 --> 00:53:38,280
I have removed the bullet.

800
00:53:39,010 --> 00:53:40,710
The patient is now out of danger,

801
00:53:41,350 --> 00:53:43,520
but he'll need some time to recover.

802
00:53:44,680 --> 00:53:45,760
I'll take my leave now.

803
00:53:49,711 --> 00:53:50,905
- Yes!
- Yes!

804
00:53:50,930 --> 00:53:53,900
- My bro made it!
- My boy's tough as nails.

805
00:53:54,830 --> 00:53:56,610
Keep it down, everyone.
We're in a hospital.

806
00:54:02,460 --> 00:54:03,040
Hey.

807
00:54:03,810 --> 00:54:05,190
Mungkorn is safe now.

808
00:54:05,820 --> 00:54:07,440
You can stop looking so grim now.

809
00:54:10,470 --> 00:54:11,610
Do you guys think...

810
00:54:12,160 --> 00:54:13,180
he'd have ended up like this

811
00:54:13,800 --> 00:54:14,890
if I'd been better

812
00:54:15,610 --> 00:54:16,980
or more careful?

813
00:54:17,360 --> 00:54:18,200
Inspector,

814
00:54:18,800 --> 00:54:19,960
stop blaming yourself.

815
00:54:21,180 --> 00:54:23,390
I'm sure Mungkorn already knew...

816
00:54:23,800 --> 00:54:25,000
that being a police officer

817
00:54:25,360 --> 00:54:26,750
comes with its fair share of risks.

818
00:54:27,620 --> 00:54:28,580
In fact,

819
00:54:29,240 --> 00:54:31,260
he might even be happy when he wakes up

820
00:54:31,980 --> 00:54:34,010
and realizes you...

821
00:54:34,710 --> 00:54:37,170
care about him
like you're in love with him.

822
00:54:42,480 --> 00:54:43,230
That's true.

823
00:54:44,080 --> 00:54:46,950
Mungkorn must be proud of you, too.

824
00:54:49,120 --> 00:54:49,860
Yeah.

825
00:55:06,040 --> 00:55:07,360
The patient is awake,

826
00:55:07,390 --> 00:55:08,910
but he's still a bit dazed

827
00:55:08,940 --> 00:55:10,750
and confused
from the effects of the medication.

828
00:55:10,860 --> 00:55:13,110
I suggest visitors go in one at a time.

829
00:55:13,280 --> 00:55:14,690
Okay, I'll go first.

830
00:55:14,710 --> 00:55:15,420
Right this way.

831
00:55:17,430 --> 00:55:18,495
I can go in now, right?

832
00:55:18,520 --> 00:55:19,370
- Yes.
- Yes.

833
00:55:32,320 --> 00:55:34,020
He's still groggy from the anesthesia.

834
00:55:34,340 --> 00:55:35,910
His condition is stable for now.

835
00:55:37,860 --> 00:55:38,410
Okay.

836
00:55:39,280 --> 00:55:40,290
Hey...

837
00:55:41,820 --> 00:55:43,670
What happened to me?

838
00:55:44,640 --> 00:55:45,780
You just had surgery.

839
00:55:46,380 --> 00:55:47,640
You were shot.

840
00:55:50,320 --> 00:55:51,810
I was shot?

841
00:55:53,990 --> 00:55:55,910
Did it hit my heart?

842
00:55:57,233 --> 00:55:59,090
Where is my heart?

843
00:55:59,660 --> 00:56:01,120
Your heart is still there.

844
00:56:05,730 --> 00:56:06,740
Where is it?

845
00:56:11,640 --> 00:56:12,570
Right here.

846
00:56:16,170 --> 00:56:17,430
Your heart is right here.

847
00:56:20,660 --> 00:56:22,230
I'll take my leave now.

848
00:56:23,100 --> 00:56:24,160
Thank you very much.

849
00:56:31,000 --> 00:56:32,650
It really is here.

850
00:56:34,420 --> 00:56:35,860
It's beating so fast.

851
00:56:44,370 --> 00:56:45,730
Who are you?

852
00:56:55,320 --> 00:56:56,910
Why are you so handsome?

853
00:57:04,270 --> 00:57:05,540
My name is Thear.

854
00:57:07,300 --> 00:57:08,410
Inspector Thear.

855
00:57:09,170 --> 00:57:10,600
- Thear...
- Do you remember me?

856
00:57:14,090 --> 00:57:16,540
I think I've seen you before.

857
00:57:19,090 --> 00:57:19,970
Really?

858
00:57:20,764 --> 00:57:22,050
Where did you see me?

859
00:57:24,250 --> 00:57:25,720
In my sleep...

860
00:57:27,640 --> 00:57:30,380
I dream about you all the time.

861
00:57:33,580 --> 00:57:35,530
Does that mean I'm...

862
00:57:37,780 --> 00:57:40,630
so handsome that you dream about me?

863
00:57:44,140 --> 00:57:45,080
Oh...

864
00:57:52,060 --> 00:57:53,510
But I think...

865
00:57:55,340 --> 00:57:57,490
I like you.

866
00:58:06,930 --> 00:58:08,870
I like you, too.

867
00:58:10,340 --> 00:58:11,630
When I dream,

868
00:58:13,370 --> 00:58:15,040
I only dream about you, Mungkorn.

869
00:58:17,000 --> 00:58:18,380
Mungkorn?

870
00:58:20,820 --> 00:58:22,780
Is my name Mungkorn?

871
00:58:24,270 --> 00:58:25,210
Yeah.

872
00:58:26,120 --> 00:58:27,750
Your name is Mungkorn,

873
00:58:29,150 --> 00:58:31,450
and you are the love of my life.

874
00:58:34,760 --> 00:58:35,870
The love of your life?

875
00:58:38,590 --> 00:58:39,900
Does that mean...

876
00:58:41,530 --> 00:58:44,360
I'm your love, Inspector Thear?

877
00:58:44,470 --> 00:58:49,150
♪That level of cuteness
is against the law♪

878
00:58:49,390 --> 00:58:54,050
♪I must be under your spell,
can I blame you at all?♪

879
00:58:54,250 --> 00:58:56,830
♪You're guilty
of messing with my heart,♪

880
00:58:56,860 --> 00:58:59,170
♪Stirring up my feelings
right from the start,♪

881
00:58:59,190 --> 00:59:02,110
♪The fine you'll pay
is your whole heart♪

882
00:59:02,510 --> 00:59:06,530
♪You take the blame,
I'll take the love part♪

883
00:59:12,370 --> 00:59:16,380
♪You take the blame,
I'll take the love part♪

884
00:59:21,492 --> 00:59:23,038
- From this day forward,
- From this day forward...

885
00:59:23,063 --> 00:59:26,432
may there be
no more hardship or harm in our lives.

886
00:59:26,485 --> 00:59:30,358
And may we live happily
for many years to come.

887
00:59:30,865 --> 00:59:32,396
Ever since we got married,

888
00:59:32,978 --> 00:59:34,760
my luck has gone downhill.

889
00:59:35,186 --> 00:59:37,330
Looks like your bad luck
finally wore off.

890
00:59:37,822 --> 00:59:38,957
I'm the one stuck with it now.

891
00:59:44,000 --> 00:59:46,430
♪When you smile♪

892
00:59:46,450 --> 00:59:48,890
♪And you look into my eyes,♪

893
00:59:48,920 --> 00:59:53,230
♪It's too much for this heart
to keep inside♪

894
00:59:53,820 --> 00:59:56,220
♪Almost forgot how to breathe,♪

895
00:59:56,240 --> 00:59:58,700
♪How could you do this to me?♪

896
00:59:58,730 --> 01:00:04,300
♪Told you to stop,
but you wouldn't agree♪

897
01:00:04,760 --> 01:00:07,270
♪With all the evidence I have found,♪

898
01:00:07,300 --> 01:00:11,180
♪Guess I'll have to take you
into custody now♪

899
01:00:11,200 --> 01:00:16,000
♪That level of cuteness
is against the law♪

900
